  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9d7ea898f0605b46b3aa06c5dd60dfb1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: 'Ledger: the astronomer'
  Body: 'BLOOD LEDGER / THE ASTRONOMER


    The bargain is a toll, not a hunger.
    The bell rings, he wakes, the night goes on.


    If the last stroke is ever
    allowed to fade without a second ring, the toll is paid out. I set the hilt where
    my missing planet should turn.'
